# Applies to every image built with tinyshop/ as the build context (all services share it),
# so a rule here must suit every service's Dockerfile, not just one.
# Everything listed is left out of the build context: never sent to the Docker engine,
# so it can't end up in an image or invalidate a cached layer.

# --- Secrets and local configuration --------------------------------------------------
# Real values must never reach an image, not even an intermediate build stage.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Build output and test artifacts --------------------------------------------------
# Built inside the image; local copies would only conflict with it.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/TestResults/

# --- Not needed to build any image ----------------------------------------------------
**/tests/
docs/
infrastructure/
.editorconfig
**/node_modules/

# --- Editor and repository clutter ----------------------------------------------------
.git
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# NOT excluded on purpose:
#   proto/              the gRPC services (payment, order) compile their code from it
#   shared/             the services' Api projects reference its projects (decision D25)
#   dotnet-tools.json   migration images restore dotnet-ef from it
